  "id": "ontogeny",
  "term": "ontogeny",
  "definition": "Ontogeny is the development of an individual organism or person, as distinguished from the evolutionary development of a species, or phylogeny. In this historical usage, it includes both development and growth, and was often discussed in relation to whether individual development reflects parts of a species’ evolutionary history.",
